  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :&nbsp;</strong><a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/mppsc-ses-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC)</a></span> has released the result for the post of <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">State Engineering Services Examination (SES)</span> on the official website. Applications for the <span style=\"font-size: inherit;\">MPPSC SES</span> Online Form 2025 were accepted from January 20, 2026, to February 19, 2026. The written examination is going to be conducted on 22 March 2026. Candidates who had applied this form can download their MPPSC SES Result 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Madhya Pradesh Public Service Commission (MPPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">MPPSC SES Result 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">MPPSC SSE Advt No. : 08/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>20 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>19 February 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>19 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Late Fee Payment Last Date&nbsp; : <strong>27 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Date :&nbsp;<strong>21 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Exam Date :&nbsp;<strong>22 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>13 March 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Answer Key : <strong>09 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Result Available : <strong>02 June 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, Other State :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 500/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">MP Reserve Category&nbsp;:&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 250/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Portal Charges : <strong>Rs. 40/- (Included)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Correction Charges : <strong>Rs. 50/- (Extra)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Late Fess : <strong>Rs. 3000/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC SES Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit As On 01 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per MPPSC SES Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC SES 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 32 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Posts</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Engineer (Civil)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">24</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Engineer (Electrical/ Mechanical)</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">07</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Agricultural Engineer</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>MPPSC SES Recruitment 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates having B.E / B.Tech Degree in Civil / Electrical/ Mechanical / Agricultural Engineering from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download MPPSC SES Result 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then click on the Download Result link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the result.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">The candidate can also download their result download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>MPPSC SES Online Form 2026 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Pre Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview (Viva-Voce)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: